      "source": [
        [
          "python",
          "Effect of Training Size on Depth=15 Tree\n============================================================\nTrain Size   Train R\u00b2   Test R\u00b2    Gap      Status         \n------------------------------------------------------------\n500          0.9989     0.6234     0.3755   Overfitting    \n1000         0.9985     0.6892     0.3093   Overfitting    \n2000         0.9979     0.7401     0.2578   Overfitting    \n5000         0.9968     0.7823     0.2145   Overfitting    \n10000        0.9957     0.8012     0.1945   Overfitting    \n16512        0.9950     0.8160     0.1790   Overfitting    \n============================================================\n\nAs training size increases, the gap narrows (variance decreases)"
        ]
